Error: Jet.ComputedFieldAssigned: `attack` is a computed field on `Stats` — it can't be set
  --> Tests/UI/computed_field_set.jet:7:29
    |
  7 |     s := Stats{strength: 10, attack: 5}
    |                              ^^^^^^
 Why: `attack` is declared `attack -> …` — its value always comes from that formula, never from a struct literal
 Fix: Remove `attack` from this `.{ … }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ComputedFieldAssigned
